    "name_raw": "Nightmare Weaver",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Ultimate Combat",
    "definition_raw": "You can use your ability to create magical darkness to terrorize enemies.\n\nPrerequisite: Improved Unarmed Strike, Nightmare Fist, Intimidate 2 ranks, ability to cast darkness.\n\nBenefit: By spending a full-round action to cast darkness, you can also make Intimidate checks to demoralize all foes in the spell’s initial area.\n\nSpecial: This feat counts as Dazzling Display for purposes of qualifying for Deadly Stroke and Shatter Defenses.",
